          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கல்வியறிவு — kalviyaṟivu — \"literacy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "இந்த மாவட்டத்தில் கல்வியறிவு அதிகரித்திருக்கிறது. inta māvaṭṭattil kalviyaṟivu atikarittirukkiṟatu. Literacy has risen in this district."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கல்வி, education + அறிவு, knowledge."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கல்வியறிவு (kalviyaṟivu) is native: kalvi, \"learning, education\", from kal, \"to learn\" (DEDR 1297), and aṟivu, \"knowledge\" (DEDR 314)."
            }
          ]
        },
